---
manual: events.click
lines: [2187, 2193]
testability: interactive
display: native
ledger: E8
----------- app code
# Hackety Hack's side tabs are images with click blocks, and an empty stack the size of the
# window lies over them once the intro is skipped. A press the stack does not want goes on to
# the picture beneath, as it does to a shape (Shoes 3's shoes_canvas_send_click2).
$clicks = []
Shoes.app width: 200, height: 120 do
  @icon = image "assets/red-40x30.png", left: 20, top: 20
  @icon.click { |button, left, top| $clicks << [button, left, top] }
  stack left: 0, top: 0, width: 1.0, height: 1.0
end
----------- test code
click_at 40, 35
assert_equal [[1, 40, 35]], $clicks, "the image hears the press, with the button and where it landed"
click_at 150, 100
assert_equal 1, $clicks.size, "and a press beside it reaches nothing"
